---
/**
 * Scene 03: Intro.
 * The dive lands on a full orange field. The headline rises, then the field
 * squeezes into the skills band's strip, where the block takes it over.
 */
---

<section id="about" class="intro-scene relative min-h-svh overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="intro-heading">
  <div class="intro-field" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="intro-content relative z-10 grid min-h-svh grid-cols-12 content-center gap-x-5 gap-y-6 px-5 py-24 md:px-8">
    <p class="intro-label type-label col-span-12 md:col-span-2">About</p>

    <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-9 md:col-start-3">
      <h2 id="intro-heading" class="intro-headline font-head font-bold">
        I design interfaces and build what runs behind them.
      </h2>

      <div class="intro-body mt-10 grid gap-5 md:mt-14 md:max-w-[52rem] md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-8">
        <p>
          I’m a Computer Science student in Jakarta, graduating in 2028. I work where design meets engineering:
          I draw the interface, then build the motion, the 3D, the type, and the systems that keep its numbers
          honest.
        </p>
        <p>
          Outside class I build AI agent tooling and market-research engines. They taught me to test things
          properly and to label every number for what it is.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Overlap the title by a few px so no cream sub-pixel seam shows at the hand-off. */
  /* z-index: once the pin ends GSAP leaves a transform on this section, which
     makes it a stacking context at z 0. Lift it so the headline stays above the
     orange block (z 5) that waits as the skills strip. */
  .intro-scene {
    margin-top: -3px;
    z-index: 10;
  }
  .intro-field {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: var(--color-signal);
  }
  .intro-headline {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6.4vw, 7.5rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    max-width: 14ch;
  }
  .intro-body {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.15vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>
